# Machine-regenerated runtime logs. On 2026-08-28 an agent's `git add -A`
# swept 435 untracked scratch files into the repo; this guards against that
# mistake, NOT against the handoff loop - the watcher only ever commits
# TRACKED files (it filters "??" lines), so untracked scratch was never at
# risk from it.
#
# DELIBERATELY NARROW. Only the families that are rewritten every session and
# are never cited as proof are listed. The _canary_* / _live_* / _prove* /
# _redproof_* / _mini_* families are EVIDENCE - STAGES.md names those files
# one by one - so they stay committable, and a future proof log will never be
# silently swallowed by this block.
/_logs_persona_*
/_logs_frontend_*
/_logs_server_*
/_logs_vite_*
/_logs_5050*
/_logs_5051*
/_logs_5058*
/_logs_stack_button.txt
/_sweep_p3_*/
/tmp_*.json
